{"story":{"id":"event-first-contact-295","title":{"zh":"研究外星材料","en":"Alien Materials Studied"},"category":"society","kind":"event","image":"art/80aca0711ce001dcbf46.webp","start":"first_contact.295","chapters":1,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"对于在[This.ContactCountry.GetName]中俘获的飞船的研究已经结束。没能抓到一个活口使得这次调查极具挑战。不过幸运的是，他们还是留给我们的[This.Owner.GetLinguists]丰富的材料用以破解它们的语言，我们现在将其识别为[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]，如果我们乐意的话还能和对方进行沟通。此外，我们还能够研究它们在自己舰船上使用的科技，这能帮助我们的[This.Owner.GetResearchers]在研究突破上找到全新的思路。","en":"We have concluded our study of the vessel we recently captured from the [This.ContactCountry.GetName]. The absence of a living crew made our investigation challenging. Fortunately, they left behind enough material for our [This.Owner.GetLinguists] to gradually"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"first_contact.295","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact.295","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"研究外星材料","en":"Alien Materials Studied"},"texts":[{"zh":"对于在[This.ContactCountry.GetName]中俘获的飞船的研究已经结束。没能抓到一个活口使得这次调查极具挑战。不过幸运的是，他们还是留给我们的[This.Owner.GetLinguists]丰富的材料用以破解它们的语言，我们现在将其识别为[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]，如果我们乐意的话还能和对方进行沟通。此外，我们还能够研究它们在自己舰船上使用的科技，这能帮助我们的[This.Owner.GetResearchers]在研究突破上找到全新的思路。","en":"We have concluded our study of the vessel we recently captured from the [This.ContactCountry.GetName]. The absence of a living crew made our investigation challenging. Fortunately, they left behind enough material for our [This.Owner.GetLinguists] to gradually decipher their language and identify them as the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName], allowing us to communicate with them should we so please. Furthermore, we were able to study their ship's technology, which has helped our [This.Owner.GetResearchers] uncover some novel new approaches to our own research problems."},{"zh":"对于在[This.ContactCountry.GetName]中俘获的飞船的研究已经结束。由于没能抓到一个活口来审讯，我们的调查极具挑战。幸运的是，他们还是留给我们的[This.Owner.GetLinguists]丰富的材料用以破解他们的语言，我们现在将其识别为[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]，如果我们乐意的话还能和对方进行沟通。此外，我们还能研究他们在自己舰船上使用的科技，这能帮助我们的[This.Owner.GetResearchers]在研究突破上找到全新的思路。","en":"We have concluded our study of the equipment we recently captured from the [This.ContactCountry.GetName]. Investigating it was a challenge without living specimens to interrogate. Fortunately, they left behind enough material for our [This.Owner.GetLinguists] to gradually decipher their language and identify them as the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName], allowing us to communicate with them should we so please. Furthermore, we were able to study their technology, which has helped our [This.Owner.GetResearchers] to uncover some novel new approaches to our own research problems."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/80aca0711ce001dcbf46.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"EXCELLENT","label":{"zh":"棒极了。","en":"Excellent."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"galactic_features.387","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c12129","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"tiyanki_graveyard_survey","path":"","value":true}]]],"source":"common/scripted_effects/first_contact_effects.txt:178","story":"event-galactic-features-387"},{"target":"cara.1020","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c12129","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"any_country","arg":"{…}","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"exists","arg":"event_target: